# SQL integration tests

- Prefer `isolated-test-database.js` and per-file DB isolation when provided.
- Do not assume a shared local DB name is exclusive under parallel `npm test`.
- Assert idempotency and lease fencing with reproducible timing, not flaky sleeps.
- Document required env vars in test headers; never embed production credentials.
